---
// Project: ifcJSON-based digital twin platform. Sources: Chung and Shelden, ICCCBE 2024 (the md copy holds the
// abstract only) and the Comfit-Demo repository description.
//   WEB DASHBOARD, sensor data on BIM  Comfit-Demo: "a digital twin dashboard that visualizes IoT sensor data on a BIM
//                                       model in real time"; abstract: "a prototype of the web platform"
//   LINKED DATA, ifcJSON, from ifcSPF  abstract: "converting BIM models from ifcSPF to a linked data version of ifcJSON"
//   Brick · ifcOWL                     abstract: "federates building information with IoT sensor data and ontologies,
//                                       such as Brick ontology and ifcOWL"
//   UNIVERSITY LAB, IoT sensors        abstract: "a pilot-test in a university laboratory"; "Internet of Things (IoT) sensors"
// Inferred: the arrows (sensor data up into the linked data, linked data up to the dashboard) read the abstract's
// "federates" and its sensor to application layers. Illustrative: the room, the sensor positions and the graph.
// Style C, exploded axonometric (approved style sheet, diagram-styles.html), sized for the project card:
// the drawing group is scaled, the labels are not. Classes: .dgc in global.css.
---
